{meta title='Install command', about='A command with a copy button - the text a value, escaped, and selected whole with one click.'}
<div style="width:100%; max-width:640px">
  <p>Add the package to your project:</p>
  {copy 'composer require pad/pad:^11.0'}
  <p>Or start a fresh application with the command-line tool:</p>
  {copy $command, label='Copy command'}
</div>
